{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Forty years</b> — and adjacent to it: 'and you shall know with your heart' — a hint that until forty years a man does not rise to the understanding of his master, and likewise 'a son of forty for understanding.' And 'your heart shall know' — לבבך (your heart) ascends to מ״ם (40). And so too the heart is in the middle of the body, like the letter mem, which is in the middle of the alphabet:"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:09.884761303Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}